{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Stewards of the Mysteries of God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let a man so consider us, as servants of Christ and stewards of the mysteries of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover it is required in stewards that one be found faithful. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But with me it is a very small thing that I should be judged by you or by a human "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "court. In fact, I do not even judge myself. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I know of nothing against myself, yet I am not justified by this; but He who judges me is the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore judge nothing before the time, until the Lord comes, who will both bring to light the hidden things of darkness and reveal the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "motives"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "counsels of the hearts. Then each one’s praise will come from God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fools for Christ’s Sake"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these things, brethren, I have figuratively transferred to myself and Apollos for your sakes, that you may learn in us not to think beyond what is written, that none of you may be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arrogant"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "puffed up on behalf of one against the other. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "distinguishes you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "makes you differ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from another?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And what do you have that you did not receive? Now if you did indeed receive "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " why do you boast as if you had not received "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You are already full! You are already rich! You have reigned as kings without us—and indeed I could wish you did reign, that we also might reign with you! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I think that God has displayed us, the apostles, last, as men condemned to death; for we have been made a spectacle "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. theater"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the world, both to angels and to men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fools for Christ’s sake, but you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " wise in Christ! We "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " weak, but you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " strong! You "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " distinguished, but we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " dishonored! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To the present hour we both hunger and thirst, and we are poorly clothed, and beaten, and homeless. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we labor, working with our own hands. Being reviled, we bless; being persecuted, we endure; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "being defamed, we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "exhort, encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "entreat. We have been made as the filth of the world, the offscouring of all things until now."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Paul’s Paternal Care"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I do not write these things to shame you, but as my beloved children I warn "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For though you might have ten thousand instructors in Christ, yet "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "have"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " many fathers; for in Christ Jesus I have begotten you through the gospel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I urge you, imitate me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason I have sent Timothy to you, who is my beloved and faithful son in the Lord, who will remind you of my ways in Christ, as I teach everywhere in every church."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now some are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arrogant"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "puffed up, as though I were not coming to you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I will come to you shortly, if the Lord wills, and I will know, not the word of those who are puffed up, but the power. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the kingdom of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not in word but in power. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What do you want? Shall I come to you with a rod, or in love and a spirit of gentleness?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}